#. ja: おお……  これが「女王の光輪」と呼ばれし  ボズヤ･クリスタル……<br>今こそ  聖剣セイブ・ザ・クイーンの  真の力を解き放とうぞ……
#. de: Die Gloriole der Königin ... Was für ein Anblick! Jetzt endlich kann ich die wahre Kraft der Königinnenwache entfesseln.
#. fr: Le nimbe royal... Je vais enfin pouvoir rompre le sceau de l'épée et libérer son vrai pouvoir...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonMYC2_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONMYC2_00000_MEESIYA_000_050:1"
msgid "At last... The power to reclaim what is mine. What is <i>ours</i>..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 我  女王グンヒルドの遺志を継ぎ  聖剣とともに<br>ボズヤに仇なす者どもを  討ち滅ぼさん……
#. de: Ich halte das Schwert Gunnhildrs<br>Und gelobe, ihren Willen zu ehren.<br>Ich werde es führen,<br>Bis auch der letzte Feind Bozjas niedergestreckt ist.
#. fr: Moi et la lame sacrée de Bozja accomplirons la dernière volonté de Gunnhildr... et exterminerons tous ceux qui ont bafoué notre nom...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonMYC2_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONMYC2_00000_MEESIYA_000_051:1"
msgid "The will of Queen Gunnhildr shall not be denied.<br>All who oppose Bozja must fall."
msgstr ""

#. ja: あれが真の闘神――  セイブ・ザ・クイーン！
#. de: Das ist die wahre Kriegsgöttin<nbsp>...
#. fr: Garde-la-Reine, sous sa véritable forme<nbsp>! Nous arrivons trop tard<nbsp>!
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonMYC2_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONMYC2_00000_MIKOTO_000_052:1"
msgid "By the gods... She has become a vessel for the blade's power!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 馬鹿な……  我が怨み……  我が一族の怨みを晴らさねば……<br>憎きボズヤに  我が怒りの鉄槌をッ！！！
#. de: Nein! Ich muss meinen Hass ... den Hass meines Volkes entfesseln! Das ganze verfluchte Bozja soll meinen zornigen Schlag spüren!
#. fr: Non<nbsp>! Je porte en moi l'amertume de tout un peuple... Bozja mérite de subir notre furie<nbsp>!!!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonMYC2_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONMYC2_00000_MEESIYA_000_100:1"
msgid "No... No, we have suffered too long for it to end this way.<br>Bozja is <i>ours</i>! If we cannot have it, no one will!"
msgstr ""
